        "description": "GitHub Actions ON-DEMAND apply/destroy role for the SANDBOX account (222222222222). OIDC trust is GATED to the dedicated 'sandbox-apply' GitHub environment (sub repo:example-org/telemetry-platform:environment:sandbox-apply), mirroring prod's prod-apply gating. Deploy identity for the ephemeral workflow_dispatch performance-test lifecycle (stand up + run-all destroy the sandbox stack). Sandbox stays ci_deploy=false; resolved only when a run sets TT_ON_DEMAND_APPLY AND accounts.json declares ci_deploy_on_demand=true. AdministratorAccess (create side) + sandbox-teardown-sweep inline policy (destroy, mirrors the QA terratest sweep). No dns-writer assume grant -- an on-demand run must scope to the sandbox service account's own units."
